_Dual-domain simultaneous stacking._ Using `ConceptGrafter` with identical default hyperparameters ($theta = 35 degree, gamma = 0.60$, `read_layers=[2,12,18]`, `write_layer=35`), we grafted *Concept 1 (`CHEMO + Iceland`, `G1=151700`)* and then stacked *Concept 2 (`AUDIO + Japan`, `G2=151701`)* into the exact same checkpoint (`66,560` total floats = `0.0017%` of 4B; 41.5s total on one RTX 4000 Ada). Figure 2 and Table 2 summarize all held-out receipts.

